# OpenZeppelin Upgrades manifests are local to each environment (the Sapphire
# testnet manifest lives at solidity/.openzeppelin/unknown-23295.json). Commit
# manifests for any chain you intend to upgrade later, ignore the rest. The
# entry below is intentionally narrow so you do not accidentally lose an
# upgrade-safety manifest.
solidity/.openzeppelin/unknown-*.json
!solidity/.openzeppelin/unknown-23295.json
